### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health

### Get Pricing
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/pricing

### Detect AI Content - AI-Generated Text
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/detect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "In today's digital age, it is important to note that artificial intelligence has revolutionized content creation. Furthermore, machine learning algorithms continue to evolve. Moreover, these advancements are significant.",
  "api_key": "test_key_12345"
}

### Detect AI Content - Human Text
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/detect
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Just got back from the most amazing coffee shop! The barista was super friendly and made incredible latte art. Honestly, I've been trying to replicate it at home but failing miserably lol. Anyone got tips?",
  "api_key": "test_key_12345"
}

### Batch Detection
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/detect/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": [
    "In conclusion, the research demonstrates significant findings in the field of machine learning and artificial intelligence.",
    "omg just saw the funniest thing at work today!! my boss accidentally sent a meme to the entire company 😂😂"
  ],
  "api_key": "test_key_12345"
}
